{"seq":44,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2549"},"reason":"Ireland in 1997 was not the last country in Europe to allow divorce: Malta banned it until 2011 (BBC, Guardian, Independent). Ireland was the last member state of the then EU; Malta, an EU member from 2004, later took over that title.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2011/may/27/malta-votes-on-divorce-catholic-church"},{"url":"https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/world-europe-14285882"},{"url":"https://www.independent.co.uk/news/world/europe/malta-to-legalise-divorce-after-bitter-referendum-2290802.html"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",354],["-","at "],["=",2],["-","time,"],["+","last"],["=",1],["+","member state of "],["=",2],["-","last"],["+","then"],["=",1],["-","country"],["+","European"],["=",1],["+","Union to allow divorce; "],["=",4],["-","to"],["+","only"],["=",1],["-","allow"],["+","Malta"],["=",1],["-","divorce"],["+","and"],["=",1],["-","(Vatican"],["+","Vatican"],["=",3],["-","aside)."],["+","still"],["=",1],["-","Malta"],["+","had"],["=",1],["+","none. Malta, which joined the EU in 2004, "],["=",583]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",362],["-","damals"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","das "],["=",2],["-","Land"],["+","Mitgliedstaat"],["=",1],["-","Europas,"],["+","der"],["=",1],["-","das"],["+","damaligen"],["=",1],["+","Europäischen Union, der "],["=",4],["-","erlaubte"],["+","erlaubte;"],["=",1],["-","(den"],["+","in"],["=",1],["-","Vatikanstaat"],["+","Europa"],["=",1],["-","ausgenommen)."],["+","verboten"],["=",1],["+","sie nun nur noch Malta und der Vatikanstaat. "],["=",4],["-","Malta"],["+","Malta,"],["=",1],["+","seit 2004 EU-Mitglied, "],["=",557]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",316],["-","тогда"],["+","последним"],["=",1],["-","последней"],["+","государством"],["=",1],["-","страной"],["+","—"],["=",1],["-","Европы,"],["+","членом"],["=",1],["-","разрешившей"],["+","тогдашнего"],["=",1],["-","развод"],["+